      "updated": 1770475962956,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "embedding层向量数据量\nEmbedding 查找表 (vocab_size × hidden_size 矩阵)\nds v3：\nvocab_size = 129280（实际词表128000）\nhidden_size = 1024（demo）\ndata_type = float(4B)\n>>> 128000*1024*4 /1024/1024/1024\n0.48828125 GB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "embedding层向量数据量\nEmbedding 查找表 (vocab_size × hidden_size 矩阵)\nds v3：\nvocab_size = 129280（实际词表128000）\nhidden_size = 1024（demo）\ndata_type = float(4B)\n>>> 128000*1024*4 /1024/1024/1024\n0.48828125 GB",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kDyc1FsQCqKtNw9B05niH",
