    {
      "id": "jDSafabVuxcT_OHzajwYh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 833.8394092513918,
      "y": 875.0314099417207,
      "width": 566.7327784139942,
      "height": 361.46727829734067,
      "angle": 0.005331864338271153,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 861744322,
      "version": 1639,
      "versionNonce": 258869459,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770475962957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Engram 模块数据量 = 27B/40B * date-type  \nembedding数据量：\nhash表数据量：\n\n异步h2d时间窗：~328us\n1/50 = 20ms/token\n20/61 = 328us/layer\n推算H2D带宽需求：\n>>> 128/1024/328*1000*1000\n381.0975609756098\n（128MB Engram数据量更新需要带宽381 GB/s），实际取决于\n更新数据量的峰值\n\n>>> 220 * 328/1000/1000 * 1024\n73.89184 MB（200GB/s带宽支持传输窗口内支持传输数据量）",
      "fontSize": 19.278254842524838,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Engram 模块数据量 = 27B/40B * date-type  \nembedding数据量：\nhash表数据量：\n\n异步h2d时间窗：~328us\n1/50 = 20ms/token\n20/61 = 328us/layer\n推算H2D带宽需求：\n>>> 128/1024/328*1000*1000\n381.0975609756098\n（128MB Engram数据量更新需要带宽381 GB/s），实际取决于更新数据量的峰值\n\n>>> 220 * 328/1000/1000 * 1024\n73.89184 MB（200GB/s带宽支持传输窗口内支持传输数据量）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
