    {
      "id": "UyjbAKBXvsOkxMl4Qk_z5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1935.3302070650532,
      "y": -382.4116727003869,
      "width": 296.5744178296621,
      "height": 429.3371540950079,
      "angle": 0.005331864338271153,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 180385310,
      "version": 2178,
      "versionNonce": 2071174717,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770475962957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "使用的hash算法是什么？\n    Engram 使用的是 基于模运算\n和按位异或 的混合哈希算法。不是\n标准的加密哈希（如 MD5、\nSHA256）\n\nhash表的数据量是多少？\n    等于压缩后原本词表的大小\n    128815*8B\n    >>> 128815*8/1024/1024\n    0.9827804565429688 MB\n\nembedding表数据量是什么？\n    见右\n    \n需要cpu做什么？\n    hash查找/embedding查\n找/tokenizer压缩词表",
      "fontSize": 19.081651293111463,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "使用的hash算法是什么？\n    Engram 使用的是 基于模运算和按位异或 的混合哈希算法。不是标准的加密哈希（如 MD5、SHA256）\n\nhash表的数据量是多少？\n    等于压缩后原本词表的大小\n    128815*8B\n    >>> 128815*8/1024/1024\n    0.9827804565429688 MB\n\nembedding表数据量是什么？\n    见右\n    \n需要cpu做什么？\n    hash查找/embedding查找/tokenizer压缩词表",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aZs1mD0Qc9aDqF06huUk_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -367.55238926333925,
      "y": -373.00092334197444,
      "width": 525.6786264171136,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 262560066,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 1573531667,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770475962957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "搞清楚\n1、Engram demo流程，对cpu诉求是什么？\n2、可以在cpu/gpu上做，两者对比",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "搞清楚\n1、Engram demo流程，对cpu诉求是什么？\n2、可以在cpu/gpu上做，两者对比",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uO6QqDqf3cgn3YGCpp-Oe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -365.199211532131,
      "y": -198.008363389014,
      "width": 511.23980712890625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1625055902,
      "version": 715,
      "versionNonce": 1597951645,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770475962957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "cpu上做的事情\n1、tokenizer（cpu）\n2、表卸载存储，异步h2d （cpu）\n3、hash （cpu/npu）\n4、embedding（npu）\n\n数据量\ninput-ids：16KB（seq_len 2k）\nLLM-embedding：0.49GB（demo，float）\nEngram-hash表：1MB（demo，未*压缩系数）\nEngram-embedding：4.93 GB（demo，2层，float）\n\n处理时延\ncompressToken处理：xx us (seq_len 2k)\nhash计算：cpu xx ms/npu xx ms\nembedding lookup：cpu xx ms/npu xx ms\nh2d窗口：～328us （220GB/s带宽支持传输73.9MB）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cpu上做的事情\n1、tokenizer（cpu）\n2、表卸载存储，异步h2d （cpu）\n3、hash （cpu/npu）\n4、embedding（npu）\n\n数据量\ninput-ids：16KB（seq_len 2k）\nLLM-embedding：0.49GB（demo，float）\nEngram-hash表：1MB（demo，未*压缩系数）\nEngram-embedding：4.93 GB（demo，2层，float）\n\n处理时延\ncompressToken处理：xx us (seq_len 2k)\nhash计算：cpu xx ms/npu xx ms\nembedding lookup：cpu xx ms/npu xx ms\nh2d窗口：～328us （220GB/s带宽支持传输73.9MB）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Sg3hR_La_LTdlJ2g4z6DY",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 2268.20566761667,
      "y": -373.8408756135215,
      "width": 896,
      "height": 285,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
